+ *   3. ../prebuilds/ relative to this module  — upstream behaviour, i.e. a
+ *      normal interpreted install out of node_modules. Unchanged.
+ *
+ * Set ZIGPTY_DEBUG=1 to print why each candidate was rejected. Failing to load
+ * the addon stays non-fatal (pipe fallback is a legitimate outcome on an
+ * unsupported platform), but it must no longer be INVISIBLE — silent
+ * degradation is exactly what let the bundling bug ship.
